msgstr "رئيس (ليس عضواً)"

#. ---- the change-placement screen --------------------------------------------------------
#.
#. "home: {0}" was removed rather than translated again. It repeated the unit the row already
#. named: the placement column beside it shows the main placement on the same structure the list is
