msgid "Position"
msgstr "المنصب"

#: Views/Shared/_JobAndOrganisation.cshtml
msgid "Organisation"
msgstr "الهيكل التنظيمي"

#: Views/Shared/_JobAndOrganisation.cshtml
msgid "Reports to"
msgstr "يتبع"

#: Views/Shared/_JobAndOrganisation.cshtml
msgid "Headcount"
msgstr "العدد"

#: Views/EmployeePlacementAdmin/Index.cshtml
msgid "Grade"
msgstr "الدرجة"

#. ---- Slice F6b item 1: the fixed "Job and organisation" block on Create and Edit ----
#. The same block the Placement screen shows, on the two screens an employee record is made and
#. read on. The strings below are the ones those two screens add; everything the block itself says
#. is above, under _JobAndOrganisation, because one partial renders it on all of them.

#: Views/EmployeesAdmin/Create.cshtml
msgid "Optional. Their department, division and company follow from where the position sits — nothing else to choose. Leave it blank and add one later from their record."
msgstr "اختياري. يتبع قسمه وإدارته وشركته موقعَ المنصب — لا شيء آخر لاختياره. اتركه فارغًا وأضف منصبًا لاحقًا من سجله."

#. D26 I: the reminder is raised before the save as well as after it, because the person filling
#. this form is the one who would act on it.
#: Views/EmployeesAdmin/Create.cshtml
msgid "A position carries no permissions by itself. Review this person's access roles after adding them."
msgstr "لا يمنح المنصب أي صلاحيات بذاته. راجع أدوار الصلاحيات لهذا الشخص بعد إضافته."

#: Controllers/EmployeesAdminController.cs
msgid "Choose one of this position's own grades."
msgstr "اختر إحدى درجات هذا المنصب."

#: Controllers/EmployeesAdminController.cs
msgid "{0} holds their position from {1}."
msgstr "يشغل {0} منصبه اعتبارًا من {1}."

#: Controllers/EmployeesAdminController.cs
msgid "{0} was added but not placed. Choose a position from their record."
msgstr "تمت إضافة {0} دون إلحاقه. اختر منصبًا من سجله."

#. The employee page's copy of the block: its heading action, and the two states somebody can be
#. in without holding a post. The second is ADR-0029's mid-migration state, which D28 C requires
#. be made legible rather than hidden.
#: Views/EmployeesAdmin/Edit.cshtml
msgid "Change position or grade"
msgstr "تغيير المنصب أو الدرجة"

#: Views/EmployeesAdmin/Edit.cshtml
msgid "No position assigned. This employee is placed directly in {0}."
msgstr "لم يُسند أي منصب. هذا الموظف مُلحق مباشرةً بـ {0}."

#: Views/EmployeesAdmin/Edit.cshtml
msgid "This employee holds no position yet."
msgstr "لا يشغل هذا الموظف أي منصب بعد."

#. ---- Slice F6b item 9: the sections LOOP, which is never a list of six ----
#: Views/EmployeesAdmin/Edit.cshtml
msgid "This employee record has no sections."
msgstr "لا توجد أقسام في سجل هذا الموظف."

#. The position picker's empty option, relabelled for this screen. The control's own default is
#. "— reports to nobody —", which is right where it was built (a position's own Reports to) and
#. nonsense on a form asking which post somebody holds.
#: Views/EmployeesAdmin/Create.cshtml
msgid "— no position yet —"
msgstr "— لا يوجد منصب بعد —"

#. ---- Slice F6b polish A: the line manager follows the position (D31) ----
#. Four cases, one partial, shared by the Add-employee form and the Placement screen. D28 A still
#. decides what may be derived — one holder is a fact, several is not — and D31 adds that the
#. choice is constrained to those holders, with a labelled override for a dotted line.

#: Views/Shared/_LineManagerChoice.cshtml
msgid "Follows the position."
msgstr "يتبع المنصب."

#: Views/Shared/_LineManagerChoice.cshtml
msgid "Choose…"
msgstr "اختر…"

#: Views/Shared/_LineManagerChoice.cshtml
msgid "{0} is held by {1} people. Choose which of them this person answers to."
msgstr "يشغل {0} عددُ {1} من الأشخاص. اختر من يتبعه هذا الشخص منهم."

#. The override, and the label that keeps it from reading as the ordinary case.
#: Views/Shared/_LineManagerChoice.cshtml
msgid "Change…"
msgstr "تغيير…"

#: Views/Shared/_LineManagerChoice.cshtml
msgid "Differs from the position's reporting line."
msgstr "يختلف عن خط تبعية المنصب."

#: Controllers/EmployeesAdminController.cs
msgid "Choose one of the people who hold {0}, or use Change to name somebody else."
msgstr "اختر أحد شاغلي {0}، أو استخدم «تغيير» لتسمية شخص آخر."

#. ---- F6b polish 2: Reports to and Line manager are ONE row (D31 addendum) ----
#. The row names the post above and its state, then whoever answers for it. "Vacant" is not
#. "answers to nobody": while a manager's chair is empty the people under it answer to whoever is
#. above the gap, and the screen used to say they answered to no one.

#: Views/Shared/_JobAndOrganisation.cshtml
msgid "Nobody — top of the reporting line"
msgstr "لا أحد — أعلى خط التبعية"

#. The post first, then the person: the post is the fact and the person answers for it.
#: Views/Shared/_JobAndOrganisation.cshtml
msgid "{0} — {1} (line manager)"
msgstr "{0} — {1} (المدير المباشر)"

#. The acting manager: somebody holding a post ABOVE the vacant one, labelled with the post they
#. actually hold so a manager two levels up never appears unexplained.
#: Views/Shared/_LineManagerChoice.cshtml
msgid "{0} — acting ({1})"
msgstr "{0} — بالإنابة ({1})"

#: Views/Shared/_LineManagerChoice.cshtml
msgid "{0} is vacant. Choose which holder of {1} is acting."
msgstr "{0} شاغر. اختر من يتولى الإنابة من شاغلي {1}."

#. The honest end of the walk up the line: the posts exist and are empty, which is a different
#. statement from "answers to no one" and is one somebody can act on.
#: Views/Shared/_LineManagerChoice.cshtml
msgid "No one above holds a post yet"
msgstr "لا أحد في المناصب الأعلى حتى الآن"

#: Views/Shared/_LineManagerChoice.cshtml
msgid "Choose which of them this person answers to."
msgstr "اختر من يتبعه هذا الشخص منهم."

#: Views/Shared/_LineManagerChoice.cshtml
msgid "No line manager chosen"
msgstr "لم يُختر مدير مباشر"

#. ---- D31 addendum 2: a stored choice whose person has left the post it was made from ----
#. Never silently replaced: picking another holder would be the product inventing a line manager,
#. which is what D28 A refuses. The person is named, what changed is said, and the question asked
#. again.
#: Views/Shared/_LineManagerChoice.cshtml
msgid "Needs a new line manager — {0} no longer holds {1}"
msgstr "يلزم تعيين مدير مباشر جديد — لم يعد {0} يشغل {1}"
